{"3859490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shield of Valor", "steam_appid": 3859490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shield of Valor</strong> is a action platformer, side scroller, that takes heavy inspiration from classic 8 bit era games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Utilize your shield,</strong> use it to block enemy attacks, Most attacks will either have to be blocked standing or crouching so see where the attack is coming from and react accordingly. You can also attack with the shield by throwing it at them. Be careful though because once you throw the shield out you cant block anything until it comes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/b18671604c7a503fc1168712d8946bd3.poster.avif?t=1778449388\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/b18671604c7a503fc1168712d8946bd3.webm?t=1778449388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/b18671604c7a503fc1168712d8946bd3.mp4?t=1778449388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally you have a variety of sub-weapon to find in stages to help you throughout the stage, each with their own unique strengths you can capitalize on!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/8ca3b31b0becc9d962a4c51dcee2b50d.poster.avif?t=1778449388\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/8ca3b31b0becc9d962a4c51dcee2b50d.webm?t=1778449388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/8ca3b31b0becc9d962a4c51dcee2b50d.mp4?t=1778449388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action packed Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against various tough enemies that challenge your ability to block, attack and platform, some enemies have multiple attacks so be prepared to see what's coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single player Campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through multiple challenging levels, each with their own unique look and gimmicks to play around with. Each level ends with a tough boss that will test out everything you learned!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavily Retro Inspired</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Art, Music and design inspired from the 8 bit era of game while blending it in with some additional modern touches like multi layer parallax background.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shield of Valor</strong> is a action platformer, side scroller, that takes heavy inspiration from classic 8 bit era games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Utilize your shield,</strong> use it to block enemy attacks, Most attacks will either have to be blocked standing or crouching so see where the attack is coming from and react accordingly. You can also attack with the shield by throwing it at them. Be careful though because once you throw the shield out you cant block anything until it comes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/b18671604c7a503fc1168712d8946bd3.poster.avif?t=1778449388\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/b18671604c7a503fc1168712d8946bd3.webm?t=1778449388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/b18671604c7a503fc1168712d8946bd3.mp4?t=1778449388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally you have a variety of sub-weapon to find in stages to help you throughout the stage, each with their own unique strengths you can capitalize on!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/8ca3b31b0becc9d962a4c51dcee2b50d.poster.avif?t=1778449388\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/8ca3b31b0becc9d962a4c51dcee2b50d.webm?t=1778449388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/extras/8ca3b31b0becc9d962a4c51dcee2b50d.mp4?t=1778449388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action packed Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against various tough enemies that challenge your ability to block, attack and platform, some enemies have multiple attacks so be prepared to see what's coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single player Campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through multiple challenging levels, each with their own unique look and gimmicks to play around with. Each level ends with a tough boss that will test out everything you learned!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavily Retro Inspired</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Art, Music and design inspired from the 8 bit era of game while blending it in with some additional modern touches like multi layer parallax background.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Block and attack through this retro inspired action, side scroller. Play as the Shield bearer, Hjalmer as you battle your way through a grim and treacherous land to destroy the dark forces corrupting it.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/e64b630c8aef8a1c4f29312105c86d2196779c7d/header.jpg?t=1778449388", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/1e02ad3fb521a507adaa299fbf0edd57140bb3ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778449388", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859490/1e02ad3fb521a507adaa299fbf0edd57140bb3ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778449388", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 11th gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz 2.24 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> No test have been performed on older hardware as of yet.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Shield of Valor ©Frostblue 2025", "developers": ["Frostblue"], "publishers": ["Frostblue"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keybo